---
// TrendingBanner.astro - Full-width breaking updates ticker across the very top of the page
---

<div class="w-full bg-subtle text-muted text-caption-sm px-4 sm:px-6 hidden md:flex items-center h-9 border-b border-border/50 shrink-0 z-[1010] sticky top-0 select-none">
  <div class="w-full flex justify-between items-center gap-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0">
      <span class="badge-accent text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider py-0.5 px-2.5 shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-2xs">
        <span class="w-fit p-0.5 rounded-full bg-accent">
          Latest Update
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="truncate text-white text-xs font-medium">
        Confirm dates, fees, and downloads on the official portal before you apply.
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-muted shrink-0 text-xs font-medium">
      <a href="/#important-links" class="hover:text-white transition">Official portals</a>
      <span class="text-border text-[10px]">•</span>
      <a href="/#faqs" class="hover:text-white transition">FAQs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
